 Treasure County","/arc-plc/montana/treasure-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, June to July came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle ran 206% of normal in October to November but only 74% in August to September. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 59% on the middle. Grids 31291 and 31292 both had their driest year in 1952, at 46%.</p>"}
